==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fr|plaintif||aggrieved, lamenting}}, from {{m|fro|plainte||lament, complaint}}; see [[plaint]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈpleɪntɪv/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Sounding [[sorrowful]], [[mournful]] or [[melancholic]].
#: {{ux|en|A typically '''plaintive''' song from Radiohead.}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|plaint}}
* {{l|en|plaintiff}}

